            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Haha! You're welcome, @echasnovski. You are the first one to create an issue in my personal repo. I'll keep it around for a while...)\r\n\r\nI was already wondering why in issue [110](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/issues/110) the solution was [reported](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/issues/110#issuecomment-1212271855) to work for the `html` filetype...\r\n\r\nThat said, I don't think I am the right person to offer a good PR to the `nvim-treesitter-textobjects` plugin.\r\nI have no in-depth knowledge regarding the plugin and `treesitter`'s query syntax.\r\n\r\nIf you don't mind, I'll update the corresponding issue in [LazyVim](https://github.com/LazyVim/LazyVim/issues/1413), mentioning the [PR](https://github.com/abeldekat/test_mini_ai/pull/1#issue-1888832212) you created.\r\n",
