        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Hello @echasnovski,\r\n\r\nYou already wrote that the `tree-sitter` approach does not work inside comments and strings. Up until recently, I did not fully grasp the consequences of this limitation.\r\n\r\nAs `xml` is quite commonly used in other languages to manipulate data, I don't think this alternative is a solution to the problem.\r\n\r\nI hope someone else is able to submit a PR adding the `xml queries` to plugin `nvim-treesitter-textobjects`. \r\n\r\nThanks for your patience and encouragement in this conversation, and also for all the wonderful plugins you write!\r\n",
